exports[`screens > the cited brief 1`] = `"<article class="mx-auto max-w-[800px]"><div class="no-print mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Print or save as PDF</button><button type="button" class="btn">Download CSV</button><button type="button" class="btn">Download BibTeX</button><button type="button" class="btn">Copy link</button><a class="btn btn-quiet ml-auto" href="/?o2=34&amp;p=8.2">Back to the plane</a></div><header class="border-b border-line pb-6"><span class="eyebrow">Redshift brief · dataset 2026-11-14+86f35c56f2e0</span><h1 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold">Fire evidence near <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="34%. Show where this number comes from">34%</button></span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs text-ink-3">1</sup> oxygen and <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="8.2 psi. Show where this number comes from">8.2 psi</button></span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs text-ink-3">1</sup> <span class="whitespace-nowrap">(<span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="56.5 kPa. Show where this number comes from">56.5 kPa</button></span>)</span></h1><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-2">8.2 psi / 34% O2: Low-pressure, high-oxygen candidate. Named as a NASA-considered atmosphere in the ACME BRE flight objectives.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-2">Redshift informs a decision; it does not rank or recommend an atmosphere. Nearness step size 1x. Counts come from the Redshift build; each number is footnoted to its source.</p></header><section class="border-b border-line py-6 [break-inside:avoid]"><h2 class="eyebrow mb-3">What is known</h2><p class="text-base"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:total"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="37. Show where this number comes from">37</button></span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs text-ink-3">2</sup> tests sit near this point in PSI&#x27;s experiment tables and human-verified papers. None is a solid material.</p><table class="mt-4 w-full text-sm"><caption class="sr-only">Tests near this point by fuel class and source</caption><thead><tr class="text-left text-xs text-ink-3"><th class="py-1 font-medium">Fuel class</th><th class="font-medium">PSI tables</th><th class="font-medium">Verified papers</th><th class="font-medium">O2 matches, pressure not recorded</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-line"><td class="py-2">Gas flame</td><td><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:gas:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="20. Show where this number comes from">20</button></span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs text-ink-3">3</sup></td><td><span cla