this number comes from">16</button></span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs text-ink-3">14</sup> ACME BRE sessions list this oxygen level, but the BRE summary table does not record chamber pressure.</li><li>Across PSI&#x27;s tables: <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:0"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="263. Show where this number comes from">263</button></span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs text-ink-3">16</sup> solid-fuel burn rows, of which <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:1"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="129. Show where this number comes from">129</button></span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs text-ink-3">17</sup> record oxygen and <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:2"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs text-ink-3">18</sup> record pressure.</li><li>A published prebreathe figure exists but has not yet been verified by a team member.</li></ul></section><section class="border-b border-line py-6 [break-inside:avoid]"><h2 class="eyebrow mb-3">Flame temperature</h2><p class="text-sm"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="ft:c8_2_34"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decora