t tests at 20.0% O2, pressure not recorded (FLEX)</title></path><text x="856" y="8" dy="0.32em" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink-2)">Droplet</text></g></g></g></g></svg><svg width="960" height="640" role="application" tabindex="0" aria-roledescription="plane" aria-label="Oxygen against cabin pressure. Probe at 31% O2 · 9 psi. Arrow keys move the probe one grid step, Alt with an arrow moves ten, Shift with an arrow jumps to the next candidate atmosphere, Enter opens its dossier, B selects an area." class="absolute inset-0 block rounded-lg focus-visible:outline-offset-[-2px]" style="will-change:transform"><defs><clipPath id="plane-clip-overlay"><rect width="848" height="464"></rect></clipPath><radialGradient id="plane-halo"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--probe)" stop-opacity="0.02"></stop><stop offset="80%" stop-color="var(--probe)" stop-opacity="0.04"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="var(--probe)" stop-opacity="0.09"></stop></radialGradient></defs><g transform="translate(56,16)"><g clip-path="url(#plane-clip-overlay)"><g class="intro-hide"><g style="transform:translate(452.26666666666665px, 283.3527195880561px);transition:transform var(--t-move) var(--ease-out)" pointer-events="none"><g class="layer" data-on="true"><ellipse rx="212" ry="149.126058741983" fill="url(#plane-halo)"></ellipse></g><line x1="-452.26666666666665" x2="395.73333333333335" y1="0" y2="0" stroke="var(--probe)" stroke-opacity="0.35"></line><line y1="-283.3527195880561" y2="180.64728041194388" x1="0" x2="0" stroke="var(--probe)" stroke-opacity="0.35"></line><circle r="12" fill="none" stroke="var(--probe)" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle r="3" fill="var(--probe)"></circle><g transform="translate(-130,16)"><rect width="114" height="24" rx="4" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--line-strong)"></rect><text x="8" y="16" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)" class="num">31% O2 · 9 psi</text></g></g></g></g><rect width="848" height="464" fill="transparent" style="cursor:grab;touch-action:none;-webkit-touch-callout:none"></rect></g></svg><span class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></span></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 px-4 pb-4 text-xs text-ink-2 lg:px-6"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block h-3 w-5 rounded-sm border border-[color:var(--coast)] bg-[color:var(--land)]"></span> Land: tests near</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="hatch-bg inline-block h-3 w-5 rounded-sm border border-line bg-[color:var(--sea)]"></span> Sea: no tests near, unknown, not safe</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 -4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 4.5,0" fill="var(--gas)" stroke="var(--gas-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Gas flame</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.175 L5.175,4.14 L-5.175,4.14 Z" fill="var(--droplet)" stroke="var(--droplet-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Droplet</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="var(--solid)" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid material</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.8500000000000005 L5.8500000000000005,0 L0,5.8500000000000005 L-5.8500000000000005,0 Z" fill="var(--emulator)" stroke="var(--emulator-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid emulator (BRE)</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="none" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="2"></path></svg> Verified paper</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" class="text-ink"><path d="M8 14.5S3.25 10.25 3.25 6.5a4.75 4.75 0 0 1 9.5 0C12.75 10.25 8 14.5 8 14.5Z"></path><circle cx="8" cy="6.5" r="1.75"></circle></svg> Candidate: inland, on the coast or at sea describes the evidence, not risk</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="20" height="8" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="0" y1="4" x2="20" y2="4" stroke="var(--isotherm)"></line></svg> Flame temperature (explains, does not predict)</span><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet ml-auto max-lg:hidden"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.25" y="3.75" width="13.5" height="8.5" rx="1.25"></rect><path d="M4 6.5h.01M6.67 6.5h.01M9.33 6.5h.01M12 6.5h.01M5 9.5h6"></path></svg> Shortcuts <span class="kbd" aria-hidden="true">?</span></button></div></section><aside class="sheet intro-dim lg:relative lg:min-h-0 lg:overflow-y-auto lg:border-l lg:border-line lg:bg-[color:var(--surface)]" data-snap="peek" aria-label="Evidence near the probe" style="--sheet-visible:280px"><button type="button" class="sheet-grip sticky top-0 z-20 flex w-full items-center justify-center bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] focus-visible:outline-offset-[-4px] lg:hidden" style="touch-action:none" aria-label="Evidence sheet, peek, showing the readout" aria-describedby=":R2:"><span class="sheet-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><span id=":R2:" hidden="">Press to step through peek, half and full; drag it, or use the arrow keys, to resize. Escape leaves full.</span><span class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></span><div class="flex min-h-full flex-col" data-testid="evidence-panel"><header class="px-5 pb-4 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><span class="eyebrow">Probe</span></div><h2 class="mt-1 text-title num max-sm:text-heading"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="31%. Show where this number comes from">31%</button></span> <span class="text-ink-3">O2</span> · <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="9 psi. Show where this number comes from">9 psi</button></span> <span class="text-base font-normal text-ink-2">(<span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="62.1 kPa. Show where this number comes from">62.1 kPa</button></span>)</span></h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm" aria-live="polite"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:total"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="34. Show where this number comes from">34</button></span> tests sit near this point. None is a solid material.</p><ul class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 md:max-lg:grid-cols-4" aria-label="Tests near this point by fuel class" data-sheet-peek=""><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 -4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 4.5,0" fill="var(--gas)" stroke="var(--gas-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Gas</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:gas:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="11. Show where this number comes from">11</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.175 L5.175,4.14 L-5.175,4.14 Z" fill="var(--droplet)" stroke="var(--droplet-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Droplet</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:droplet:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="23. Show where this number comes from">23</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 p