 cabin pressure. Probe at 34% O2 · 8.2 psi, on 8.2 psi / 34% O2, inland. The word describes the recorded evidence near this point, not fire risk. Arrow keys move the probe one grid step, Alt with an arrow moves ten, Shift with an arrow jumps to the next candidate atmosphere, Enter opens its dossier, B selects an area." class="absolute inset-0 block rounded-lg focus-visible:outline-offset-[-2px]" style="will-change:transform"><defs><clipPath id="plane-clip-overlay"><rect width="848" height="464"></rect></clipPath><radialGradient id="plane-halo"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--probe)" stop-opacity="0.02"></stop><stop offset="80%" stop-color="var(--probe)" stop-opacity="0.04"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="var(--probe)" stop-opacity="0.09"></stop></radialGradient></defs><g transform="translate(56,16)"><g clip-path="url(#plane-clip-overlay)"><g class="intro-hide"><g style="transform:translate(537.0666666666666px, 324.82739009111276px);transition:transform var(--t-move) var(--ease-out)" pointer-events="none"><g class="layer" data-on="true"><ellipse rx="212" ry="149.126058741983" fill="url(#plane-halo)"></ellipse></g><line x1="-537.0666666666666" x2="310.9333333333334" y1="0" y2="0" stroke="var(--probe)" stroke-opacity="0.35"></line><line y1="-324.82739009111276" y2="139.17260990888724" x1="0" x2="0" stroke="var(--probe)" stroke-opacity="0.35"></line><circle r="12" fill="none" stroke="var(--probe)" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle r="3" fill="var(--probe)"></circle><g transform="translate(16,-32)"><rect width="128" height="24" rx="4" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--line-strong)"></rect><text x="8" y="16" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)" class="num">34% O2 · 8.2 psi</text></g></g></g></g><rect width="848" height="464" fill="transparent" style="cursor:grab;touch-action:none;-webkit-touch-callout:none"></rect></g></svg><span class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></span></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 px-4 pb-4 text-xs text-ink-2 lg:px-6"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block h-3 w-5 rounded-sm border border-[color:var(--coast)] bg-[color:var(--land)]"></span> Land: tests near</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="hatch-bg inline-block h-3 w-5 rounded-sm border border-line bg-[color:var(--sea)]"></span> Sea: no tests near, unknown, not safe</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 -4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 4.5,0" fill="var(--gas)" stroke="var(--gas-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Gas flame</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.175 L5.175,4.14 L-5.175,4.14 Z" fill="var(--droplet)" stroke="var(--droplet-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Droplet</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="var(--solid)" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid material</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.8500000000000005 L5.8500000000000005,0 L0,5.8500000000000005 L-5.8500000000000005,0 Z" fill="var(--emulator)" stroke="var(--emulator-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid emulator (BRE)</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="none" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="2"></path></svg> Verified paper</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" class="text-ink"><path d="M8 14.5S3.25 10.25 3.25 6.5a4.75 4.75 0 0 1 9.5 0C12.75 10.25 8 14.5 8 14.5Z"></path><circle cx="8" cy="6.5" r="1.75"></circle></svg> Candidate: inland, on the coast or at sea describes the evidence, not risk</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="20" height="8" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="0" y1="4" x2="20" y2="4" stroke="var(--isotherm)"></line></svg> Flame temperature (explains, does not predict)</span><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet ml-auto max-lg:hidden"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.25" y="3.75" width="13.5" height="8.5" rx="1.25"></rect><path d="M4 6.5h.01M6.67 6.5h.01M9.33 6.5h.01M12 6.5h.01M5 9.5h6"></path></svg> Shortcuts <span class="kbd" aria-hidden="true">?</span></button></div></section><aside class="sheet intro-dim lg:relative lg:min-h-0 lg:overflow-y-auto lg:border-l lg:border-line lg:bg-[color:var(--surface)]" data-snap="peek" aria-label="Evidence near the probe" style="--sheet-visible:280px"><button type="button" class="sheet-grip sticky top-0 z-20 flex w-full items-center justify-center bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] focus-visible:outline-offset-[-4px] lg:hidden" style="touch-action:none" aria-label="Evidence sheet, peek, showing the readout" aria-describedby=":R2:"><span class="sheet-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><span id=":R2:" hidden="">Press to step through peek, half and full; drag it, or use the arrow keys, to resize. Escape leaves full.</span><span class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></span><div class="flex min-h-full flex-col" data-testid="evidence-panel"><header class="px-5 pb-4 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><span class="eyebrow">Candidate atmosphere</span></div><h2 class="mt-1 text-title num max-sm:text-heading"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="34%. Show where this number comes from">34%</button></span> <span class="text-ink-3">O2</span> · <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="8.2 psi. Show where this number comes from">8.2 psi</button></span> <span class="text-base font-normal text-ink-2">(<span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="56.5 kPa. Show where this number comes from">56.5 kPa</button></span>)</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-2">Low-pressure, high-oxygen candidate</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm" aria-live="polite"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:total"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="37. Show where this number comes from">37</button></span> tests sit near this point. None is a solid material.</p><ul class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 md:max-lg:grid-cols-4" aria-label="Tests near this point by fuel class" data-sheet-peek=""><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 -4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 4.5,0" fill="var(--gas)" stroke="var(--gas-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Gas</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:gas:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="20. Show where this number comes from">20</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.175 L5.175,4.14 L-5.175,4.14 Z" fill="var(--droplet)" stroke="var(--droplet-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Droplet</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:droplet:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="17. Show where this number comes from">17</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="true"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 -mx-1 w-fit rounded-sm bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] px-1"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="var(--solid)" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 -mx-1 w-fit rounded-sm bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] px-1"><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 italic">no tests recorded</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="true"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 -mx-1 w-fit rounded-sm bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] px-1"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.8500000000000005 L5.8500000000000005,0 L0,5.8500000000000005 L-5.8500000000000005,0 Z" fill="var(--emulator)" stroke="var(--emulator-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> BRE emulator</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 -mx-1 w-fit rounded-sm bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] px-1"><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:emulator:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 italic">no tests recorded</span></span></li></ul></header><section class="px-5 pb-4" aria-labelledby="sec-gap" data-sheet-half=""><div class="raised relative py-2 pl-4 pr-3"><span class="hatch-bg absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-2 rounded-l-lg border-r border-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 id="sec-gap" class="eyebrow">What&#x27;s missing</h2><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet -mr-2">Access gap chart</button></div><ul class="mt-1"><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm "><span class="text-ink-2">Solid-material tests near this point</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span></span></li><li class="pb-0.5 pt-1 text-xs text-ink-3 border-t border-line">Near this oxygen (within the step size), but no pressure recorded</li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm pl-3"><span class="text-ink-2">BRE sessions (chamber pressure)</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:o2match:emulator"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="16. Show where this number comes from">16</button></span></span></li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm pl-3"><span class="text-ink-2">Gas-flame tests</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:o2match:gas"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="20. Show where this number comes from">20</button></span></span></li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm border-t border-line"><span class="text-ink-2">Prebreathe figure awaits verification</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><a class="tap text-xs text-ink-2 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ink" href="/methods?open=prebreathe">Source</a></span></li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm border-t border-line"><span class="text-ink-2">Paper findings to verify, whole dataset</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:pending"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="63. Show where this number comes from">63</button></span></span></li></ul></div></section><section class="px-5 pb-4" aria-labelledby="sec-lines"><h2 id="sec-lines" class="eyebrow">Tests near, along each axis</h2><div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-xs"><span class="text-ink-2">Along oxygen at <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="fa