lor:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="16. Show where this number comes from">16</button></span></span></li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm pl-3"><span class="text-ink-2">Gas-flame tests</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:o2match:gas"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="20. Show where this number comes from">20</button></span></span></li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm border-t border-line"><span class="text-ink-2">Prebreathe figure awaits verification</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><a class="tap text-xs text-ink-2 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ink" href="/methods?open=prebreathe">Source</a></span></li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm border-t border-line"><span class="text-ink-2">Paper findings to verify, whole dataset</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:pending"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="63. Show where this number comes from">63</button></span></span></li></ul></div></section><section class="px-5 pb-4" aria-labelledby="sec-lines"><h2 id="sec-lines" class="eyebrow">Tests near, along each axis</h2><div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-xs"><span class="text-ink-2"