></div></div></section><p class="border-t border-line px-5 py-4 text-xs text-ink-3">Redshift informs a decision; it does not rank or recommend an atmosphere. Empty means unknown, never safe.</p><div class="sticky bottom-0 z-10 mt-auto border-t border-line bg-[color:var(--surface)] px-3 py-2"><nav aria-label="Take this point further"><ul class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-1"><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/dossiers/candidate/c8_2_34"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.75 4.25a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3.5l1.5 1.75h5.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6.75a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H2.75a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z"></path></svg>Dossier</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/evidence?near=34,8.2,1"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.25 4h.01M2.25 8h.01M2.25 12h.01M5.25 4h8.5M5.25 8h8.5M5.25 12h8.5"></path></svg>Tests</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/compare?pts=34,8.2;26.5,10.2&amp;m=1"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5.25h10M9.5 2.75 12 5.25 9.5 7.75"></path><path d="M14 10.75H4M6.5 8.25 4 10.75l2.5 2.5"></path></svg>Compare</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/brief?o2=34&amp;p=8.2"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.25 1.75H4.25a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v10.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V4.75Z"></path><path d="M9.25 1.75v3h3.5M5.75 8.5h4.5M5.75 11h4.5"></path></svg>Brief</a></li><li><button type="button" class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 10V1.75M5.25 4.5 8 1.75l2.75 2.75"></path><path d="M3.75 7.5v5.75a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h6.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V7.5"></path></svg>Share</button></li></ul></nav></div></div>"`;

exports[`the story intro > beat 0 matches its snapshot, with every number through Value 1`] = `"<div class="fixed inset-0 z-[58]" style="touch-action:none"><div class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer" aria-hidden="true" data-intro-catcher="true"></div><div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="intro-title" aria-describedby="intro-body" class="floating animate-rise fixed inset-x-4 bottom-4 p-3 lg:bottom-auto lg:left-auto lg:right-4 lg:top-[calc(var(--nav-h)+16px)] lg:w-[368px] lg:p-6"><span class="eyebrow max-lg:sr-only">One of three</span><div aria-live="polite" class="lg:min-h-[312px]"><h2 id="intro-title" class="swap-in text-heading lg:mt-2 lg:text-display">NASA has not chosen the <span class="whitespace-nowrap">Moon-base</span> atmosphere.</h2><p id="intro-body" class="swap-in mt-2 text-sm text-ink-2 lg:mt-4 lg:text-base">Oxygen runs across, cabin pressure up. Each pin is an atmosphere on the table, from Earth's sea-level air to thinner, oxygen-richer cabins.</p></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 lg:mt-6"><span class="flex gap-1" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--line-strong)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--line-strong)"></span></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet">Skip intro</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Next</button></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-3 max-lg:hidden">Click the plane, scroll or use the arrow keys. Esc skips.</p></div></div>"`;

exports[`the story intro > beat 1 matches its snapshot, with every number through Value 1`] = `"<div class="fixed inset-0 z-[58]" style="touch-action:none"><div class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer" aria-hidden="true" data-intro-catcher="true"></div><div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="intro-title" aria-describedby="intro-body" class="floating animate-rise fixed inset-x-4 bottom-4 p-3 lg:bottom-auto lg:left-auto lg:right-4 lg:top-[calc(var(--nav-h)+16px)] lg:w-[368px] lg:p-6"><span class="eyebrow max-lg:sr-only">Two of three</span><div aria-live="polite" class="lg:min-h-[312px]"><h2 id="intro-title" class="swap-in text-heading lg:mt-2 lg:text-display">These are the fire tests PSI lets us place.</h2><p id="intro-body" class="swap-in mt-2 text-sm text-ink-2 lg:mt-4 lg:text-base">Each mark is a microgravity fire test from NASA's PSI tables, marked by fuel class. Land means tests sit near; hatched sea is unknown, not safe.</p></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 lg:mt-6"><span class="flex gap-1" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--line-strong)"></span></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet">Skip intro</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm">Back</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Next</button></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-3 max-lg:hidden">Click the plane, scroll or use the arrow keys. Esc skips.</p></div></div>"`;

exports[`the story intro > beat 2 matches its snapshot, with every number through Value 1`] = `"<div class="fixed inset-0 z-[58]" style="touch-action:none"><div class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer" aria-hidden="true" data-intro-catcher="true"></div><div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="intro-title" aria-describedby="intro-body" class="floating animate-rise fixed inset-x-4 bottom-4 p-3 lg:bottom-auto lg:left-auto lg:right-4 lg:top-[calc(var(--nav-h)+16px)] lg:w-[368px] lg:p-6"><span class="eyebrow max-lg:sr-only">Three of three</span><div aria-live="polite" class="lg:min-h-[312px]"><h2 id="intro-title" class="swap-in text-heading lg:mt-2 lg:text-display">Now only solid materials.</h2><p id="intro-body" class="swap-in mt-2 text-sm text-ink-2 lg:mt-4 lg:text-base">No solid burn in PSI's tables records pressure. Of <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:0"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="263. Show where this number comes from">263</button></span> solid-fuel burn rows, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:1"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="129. Show where this number comes from">129</button></span> record oxygen, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:2"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span> record pressure and <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:3"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span> sit near a habitat candidate as downloadable rows.</p></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 lg:mt-6"><span class="flex gap-1" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet">Skip intro</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm">Back</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Explore</button></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-3 max-lg:hidden">Click the plane, scroll or use the arrow keys. Esc skips.</p></div></div>"`;
